  "description": "I'm an old single soul and currently working part time at a net Café. I love gaming because it gives result to my efforts, unlike reality. One day, I came across a very interesting game called \" Daughter Cultivation\" during my part time. The graphics, picture quality, voice over… everything is just so realistic! But then I realized… I was actually in the game! I couldn't believe that 24 years old me have turned into a 10 years old doll-looking-girl!!! What's more, a handsome butler is standing right in front of me. What the hell is going on…?!",
